---
description: Code quality
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx"]
---
- Strict TypeScript, no any. Server components by default; "use client" only where needed.
- Components small, colocated, named exports. Tailwind + cn() helper.
- next/image with width/height; next/font; no layout shift.
- Accessibility: semantic landmarks, aria for menus/dialogs, visible focus.
- No unused deps. Pin versions actually installed; never fabricate package names.
